text:
Ongoing and future research efforts are focused on breeding varieties of soybean with enhanced resistance. Other important research directions include:
1. testing the importance of the disease in other legume crops (e.g. beans and peas);
2. improving aphid monitoring system (testing for virus presence, minimising the usage of pesticide). Potential future research direction may include better understanding of dependency between aphid biotypes and the genotypes of *L. glycinis* in different crops. Better understanding of the impact of the virus in various legumes will improve our pest management strategies and evaluation of potential risks.
